Several people have complained of NH3.0 halting under TurboC.

I myself complained about this twice.

This can be easily solved by removing the /E(xepack) in the link
command in the makefile.  Apparently not all MS-Link /E's are compatible
with TurboC

I have fixed this, and now retract my comments about not being able to
get NH3.0 running.

